 a cada 24 horas. Antes da hemodiálise, deve ser administrada uma dose adicional de 500 mg; para repor os níveis circulantes do fármaco, deve ser administrada outra dose de 500 mg após a hemodiálise.</p><p><b>timing</b>: Once per 24 hours</p><h3>DoseAndRates</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Dose[x]</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td>500 mg<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codemg = 'mg')</span></td></tr></table></blockquote></blockquote><h3>PatientCharacteristics</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Value[x]</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Population</span></td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Doentes em hemodiálise: adultos e crianças ≥ 40 kg</span></td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>dosingGuideline</b></p><blockquote><p><b>dosage</b></p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Hemodiálise</span></p><h3>Dosages</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Text</b></td><td><b>Timing</b></td><td><b>MaxDosePerAdministration</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td>15 mg/kg/dia administrados como dose única diária (máximo 500 mg). Antes da hemodiálise, deve ser administrada uma dose adicional de 15 mg/kg; para repor os níveis circulantes do fármaco, deve ser administrada outra dose de 15 mg/kg após a hemodiálise.</td><td>Once per 1 day</td><td>500 mg<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codemg = 'mg')</span></td></tr></table></blockquote><h3>PatientCharacteristics</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Value[x]</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Population</span></td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Doentes em hemodiálise: crianças &lt; 40 kg</span></td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>dosingGuideline</b></p><blockquote><p><b>dosage</b></p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Diálise peritoneal</span></p><h3>Dosages</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Text</b></td><td><b>Timing</b></td><td><b>MaxDosePerPeriod</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td>Máximo de 500 mg/dia de amoxicilina.</td><td>Once per 1 day</td><td>500 mg<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  codemg = 'mg')</span>/1 day<span style=\"background: LightGoldenRodYellow\"> (Details: UCUM  coded = 'd')</span></td></tr></table></blockquote><h3>PatientCharacteristics</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Value[x]</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Population</span></td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Doentes em diálise peritoneal</span></td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>dosingGuideline</b></p><blockquote><p><b>dosage</b></p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Precaução na dosagem</span></p><h3>Dosages</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Text</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td>Dosear com precaução e monitorizar a função hepática em intervalos regulares.</td></tr></table></blockquote><h3>PatientCharacteristics</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Value[x]</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"display: none\">*</td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Population</span></td><td><span title=\"Codes:\">Compromisso hepático</span></td></tr></table></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>dosingGuideline</b></p><blockquote><p><b>dosage</b></p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:\">Dose única</span></p><blockquote><p><b>dosage</b></p><p><b>text</b>: 50 mg/kg oralmente, dose única 30 a 60 minutos antes do procedimento.</p><p><b>timing</b>: Count 1  times, Once</p><h3>DoseAndRates</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td style=\"display: none\">-</td><td><b>Dose[x]</b></t